IShoppingMallActor.ISummary.x-autobe-specification:
Polymorphic type computed from three actor tables. Determine actor type from JWT token. Query the appropriate table:
- For 'customer': SELECT id, email, display_name FROM shopping_mall_customers WHERE id = {actor_id}
- For 'seller': SELECT id, email, shop_name FROM shopping_mall_sellers WHERE id = {actor_id}
- For 'administrator': SELECT id, email, grade FROM shopping_mall_administrators WHERE id = {actor_id}

Return the discriminated object with 'type' field matching the actor type. Exclude sensitive fields (password_hash) and internal flags (banned, suspended, deleted_at).
